0.85 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 45 533 Td ([CRITICAL FAILURE MODE E-101] COMPRESSOR SEAL DEGRADATION - FIBERGLASS) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45 517 Td (Symptoms: Abnormal compressor vibration, oil mist leakage at flange joints, rapid pressure drop during pump-down.) Tj ET
0.2 0.2 0.2 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45 501 Td (Root Cause: Fiberglass seal rings in COMP-809 erode under thermal cycling above +120 C discharge temperature.) Tj ET
0.85 0.15 0.15 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45 483 Td (MANDATORY ACTION: URGENT ADVISORY. Replace standard fiberglass compressor seals with upgraded PTFE seal kit immediately.) Tj ET
0.99 0.93 0.85 rg 35 365 542 85 re f
0.85 0.50 0.15 RG 2 w 35 365 542 85 re S
0.85 0.50 0.15 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 45 433 Td ([HIGH RISK FAILURE MODE E-204] REFRIGERANT PRESSURE LOSS - FREON-12) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45 417 Td (Symptoms: Insufficient cooling capacity, evaporator frosting, continuous compressor operation without cycling.) Tj ET
0.2 0.2 0.2 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45 401 Td (Root Cause: Freon-12 (CFC substance) micro-leakage at condenser connection fittings.) Tj ET
0.85 0.50 0.15 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45 383 Td (MANDATORY ACTION: Verify environmental regulatory compliance and retrofit unit with approved R-410A refrigerant substitute.) Tj ET
0.90 0.97 0.90 rg 35 265 542 85 re f
0.15 0.60 0.20 RG 2 w 35 265 542 85 re S
0.15 0.60 0.20 rg BT /F2 11 Tf 45 333 Td ([NORMAL MAINTENANCE E-010] CONDENSER COIL FOULING - COPPER COIL-101) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45 317 Td (Symptoms: Slight discharge pressure elevation (+5% to +10%), increased condenser fan RPM.) Tj ET
0.2 0.2 0.2 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45 301 Td (Root Cause: Atmospheric dust and debris accumulation on Copper Alloy C101 condenser fin surfaces.) Tj ET
0.15 0.60 0.20 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45 283 Td (ROUTINE ACTION: Perform scheduled low-pressure detergent wash of copper coil fins every 6 months.) Tj ET
